WEBVTT

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:19.085
Harry!

00:00:20.782 --> 00:00:22.131
Hold on!

00:00:26.788 --> 00:00:28.964
Take my hand!

00:00:32.838 --> 00:00:34.535
Hold on!

00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:36.450
I'm trying.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:38.278
Your hand's all sweaty.

00:00:50.725 --> 00:00:52.292
I think we found the train.

00:00:52.292 --> 00:00:54.294
Yeah.

00:01:10.441 --> 00:01:12.051
Welcome home.

00:01:14.401 --> 00:01:16.098
[CAR ENGINE SEIZES UP]

00:01:28.067 --> 00:01:30.243
Up! Up!

00:01:30.243 --> 00:01:33.246
It's not working!

00:01:34.421 --> 00:01:36.075
Up!

00:01:36.075 --> 00:01:39.034
Up! Mind that tree!

00:01:41.385 --> 00:01:43.256
Stop! Stop!

00:01:43.256 --> 00:01:44.388
Stop!

00:02:06.975 --> 00:02:10.675
My wand.
Look at my wand.

00:02:10.675 --> 00:02:12.241
Be thankful it's not your neck.

00:02:12.241 --> 00:02:13.721
[CRASH]

00:02:13.721 --> 00:02:14.722
What's happening?

00:02:14.722 --> 00:02:15.723
I don't know.

00:02:15.723 --> 00:02:17.464
[GROWLING]

00:02:44.926 --> 00:02:46.232
[HARRY AND RON SCREAMING]

00:02:52.107 --> 00:02:53.500
Come on! Go!

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.241
Fast!

00:03:28.056 --> 00:03:29.580
Scabbers.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.930
You're okay.

00:03:32.931 --> 00:03:35.107
The car!

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:52.385
Dad's going to kill me.

00:04:00.654 --> 00:04:01.742
See you, Hedwig.

00:04:04.702 --> 00:04:07.095
So a house-elf
shows up in my bedroom,

00:04:07.095 --> 00:04:10.359
we can't get through the barrier
to platform 9 and 3/4,

00:04:10.359 --> 00:04:13.667
we almost get killed
by a tree...

00:04:13.667 --> 00:04:16.104
Clearly, someone
doesn't want me here this year.

00:04:16.104 --> 00:04:18.106
[♪♪♪]

00:04:20.805 --> 00:04:23.982
Well, take a good look, lads.

00:04:23.982 --> 00:04:26.071
This night
might well be the last

00:04:26.071 --> 00:04:27.986
you spend in this castle.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:34.253
Oh, dear, we are in trouble.

00:04:34.253 --> 00:04:39.084
You were seen
by no less than seven Muggles.

00:04:40.955 --> 00:04:43.871
Do you have any idea
how serious this is?

00:04:43.871 --> 00:04:48.397
You have risked
the exposure of our world.

00:04:48.397 --> 00:04:51.139
Not to mention
the damage you inflicted

00:04:51.139 --> 00:04:53.272
on a Whomping Willow
that's been on these grounds

00:04:53.272 --> 00:04:55.361
since before you were born.

00:04:55.361 --> 00:04:57.015
Honestly, Professor Snape,

00:04:57.015 --> 00:04:59.365
I think it did
more damage to us.

00:04:59.365 --> 00:05:02.107
Silence!

00:05:02.107 --> 00:05:03.804
I assure you...

00:05:03.804 --> 00:05:06.546
that were you in Slytherin,

00:05:06.546 --> 00:05:08.592
and your fate rested with me...

00:05:08.592 --> 00:05:11.725
the both of you would be
on the train home...

00:05:11.725 --> 00:05:12.944
tonight!

00:05:14.075 --> 00:05:15.250
As it is...

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.338
They are not.

00:05:18.427 --> 00:05:19.951
Professor Dumbledore.

00:05:19.951 --> 00:05:22.736
Professor McGonagall.

00:05:22.736 --> 00:05:24.085
Headmaster,

00:05:24.085 --> 00:05:26.871
these boys have flouted

00:05:26.871 --> 00:05:29.569
the Decree for the Restriction
of Underage Wizardry.

00:05:29.569 --> 00:05:30.875
As such....

00:05:30.875 --> 00:05:33.355
I am well aware of our bylaws,
Severus,

00:05:33.355 --> 00:05:36.663
having written
quite a few of them myself.

00:05:36.663 --> 00:05:40.101
However, as head
of Gryffindor House,

00:05:40.101 --> 00:05:41.929
it is for Professor McGonagall

00:05:41.929 --> 00:05:45.454
to determine
the appropriate action.

00:05:45.454 --> 00:05:47.500
We'll go and get our stuff,
then.

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:50.111
What are you talking about,
Mr. Weasley?

00:05:50.111 --> 00:05:52.940
You're going to expel us,
aren't you?

00:05:54.638 --> 00:05:56.857
Not today, Mr. Weasley.

00:05:56.857 --> 00:05:59.730
But I must impress
on both of you

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:02.907
the seriousness
of what you have done.

00:06:02.907 --> 00:06:05.649
I will be writing
to your families tonight,

00:06:05.649 --> 00:06:08.042
and you will both
receive detention.

